cue0149856
00:13:36.859 --> 00:13:39.419
The British did it.

cue0149857
00:13:39.419 --> 00:13:43.900
Napoleon left Erez Israel not because of Farhi,

cue0149858
00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.820
but because Farhi brought the British.

cue0149859
00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:50.299
And the British, they are the most intelligent foreign policy

cue0149860
00:13:50.299 --> 00:13:51.659
makers in the world.

cue0149861
00:13:51.659 --> 00:13:53.780
I mean, the most astute are the British.

cue0149862
00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:55.820
Nobody comes to the British.

cue0149863
00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:58.299
As soon as they saw Napoleon there,

cue0149864
00:13:58.299 --> 00:14:00.460
they didn't want to have Napoleon a foothold

cue0149865
00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.340
in the Middle East.

cue0149866
00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.099
They came.

cue0149867
00:14:02.099 --> 00:14:04.940
And immediately, Napoleon left.

cue0149868
00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:08.299
Now, why did he wanted to have Palestine?

cue0149869
00:14:08.299 --> 00:14:10.099
In a famous proclamation, it says,

cue0149870
00:14:10.099 --> 00:14:13.979
