cue0150767
01:06:38.139 --> 01:06:40.899
One man before Rabbi Yiśraʾel Moshe Ḥazzan

cue0150768
01:06:40.899 --> 01:06:42.899
was Rabbi Yehudah Avivas.

cue0150769
01:06:42.899 --> 01:06:45.020
Rabbi Yehudah Avivas, I have to tell you about him.

cue0150770
01:06:45.020 --> 01:06:47.500
Rabbi Yehudah Avivas was a physician.

cue0150771
01:06:47.500 --> 01:06:50.020
He was a physician, a mitchacham.

cue0150772
01:06:50.020 --> 01:06:52.820
They say that he was the greatest erudite among the Jews

cue0150773
01:06:52.820 --> 01:06:54.659
since the time of the Hiddah.

cue0150774
01:06:54.659 --> 01:06:58.540
He eventually becomes the chief Rabbi of Hebron.

cue0150775
01:06:58.540 --> 01:07:03.500
But for a while, he was the Rabbi in Corfu.

cue0150776
01:07:03.500 --> 01:07:05.020
You know Corfu, of course, yes?

cue0150777
01:07:05.020 --> 01:07:06.979
He was the Rabbi in Corfu.

cue0150778
01:07:06.979 --> 01:07:11.580
And he came out with the following idea.

cue0150779
01:07:11.580 --> 01:07:15.300
Not only like Rabbi Yiśraʾel Moshe Ḥazzan,

cue0150780
01:07:15.300 --> 01:07:18.860
we have to study science and literature and this

cue0150781
01:07:18.860 --> 01:07:21.020
and become educated.

cue0150782
01:07:21.020 --> 01:07:23.419
But the most important thing is we

cue0150783
01:07:23.419 --> 01:07:28.500
have to send our children to military academies

cue0150784
01:07:28.500 --> 01:07:33.020
to learn how to fight, to be able to take

cue0150785
01:07:33.020 --> 01:07:35.820
Erez Yiśraʾel by force.

cue0150786
01:07:35.820 --> 01:07:42.340
I have to read this to you because it's almost incredible.

cue0150787
01:07:42.340 --> 01:07:44.300
It's all of them.

cue0150788
01:07:44.300 --> 01:07:44.899
Just a second.

cue0150789
01:07:45.899 --> 01:07:54.979
In his view, somebody, how do I know this?

cue0150790
01:07:54.979 --> 01:08:03.699
There was a Protestant missionary who comes to Corfu

cue0150791
01:08:03.699 --> 01:08:07.139
and writes the memories, his memoirs, yes?

cue0150792
01:08:07.139 --> 01:08:08.780
And about what happened.

cue0150793
01:08:08.780 --> 01:08:13.060
And he tells about Rabbi Avivas.

cue0150794
01:08:13.060 --> 01:08:16.740
And he says, a fantastic says, says like this,

cue0150795
01:08:16.740 --> 01:08:19.979
that the people in Corfu, yes?

cue0150796
01:08:19.979 --> 01:08:22.740
The young men of Corfu spoke with great admiration of him,

cue0150797
01:08:22.740 --> 01:08:24.979
Rabbi Avivas, and of his sentiments.

cue0150798
01:08:24.979 --> 01:08:27.100
And especially of this one, that the Jews

cue0150799
01:08:27.100 --> 01:08:30.779
must be instructed in science and in arms

cue0150800
01:08:30.779 --> 01:08:34.500
that they may wrest the land of Palestine from the Turks

cue0150801
01:08:34.500 --> 01:08:36.580
under the leadership of the Mashiaḥ

cue0150802
01:08:36.580 --> 01:08:41.979
as the Greeks wrested their country from the Turks.

cue0150803
01:08:42.020 --> 01:08:49.259
The first people to speak about Zionism, much before Herzl,

cue0150804
01:08:49.259 --> 01:08:53.500
were the Sepharadi Ḥakhamim, all right?

cue0150805
01:08:53.500 --> 01:09:02.020
Now, he believed that we have to train our students, our boys,

cue0150806
01:09:02.020 --> 01:09:05.700
in the science of the arms.

cue0150807
01:09:05.700 --> 01:09:07.459
In one of the most interesting things,

cue0150808
01:09:07.459 --> 01:09:09.700
he goes, because he was in England,

cue0150809
01:09:09.700 --> 01:09:12.580
he goes to Moshe Montefiore.

cue0150810
01:09:12.580 --> 01:09:15.259
And he goes to Moshe Montefiore, and he tells him,

cue0150811
01:09:15.259 --> 01:09:17.259
he asks from him two things.

cue0150812
01:09:17.259 --> 01:09:18.540
He won't believe it.

cue0150813
01:09:18.540 --> 01:09:24.779
Number one, he says, you should stop giving money to Israel.

cue0150814
01:09:24.779 --> 01:09:25.819
He says, why?

cue0150815
01:09:25.819 --> 01:09:30.140
He says, because if the Jew does not

cue0150816
01:09:30.140 --> 01:09:34.419
have a military basis and a political basis,

cue0150817
01:09:34.419 --> 01:09:37.700
the fact that he's in Israel is not going to be worth it.

cue0150818
01:09:37.700 --> 01:09:39.180
That's number one.

cue0150819
01:09:39.180 --> 01:09:43.419
Number two, he was very worried of the following problem.

cue0150820
01:09:43.419 --> 01:09:48.700
He says, the Jew will become used to live by charity.

cue0150821
01:09:48.700 --> 01:09:53.339
And therefore, he says, you have to force the Jew in Israel

cue0150822
01:09:53.339 --> 01:09:57.979
to work, if needed, they have to take bayonets.

cue0150823
01:09:57.979 --> 01:09:58.819
That's what he says.

cue0150824
01:09:58.819 --> 01:10:00.979
Take a bayonet and force them to work.

cue0150825
01:10:00.979 --> 01:10:06.100
But the Jew in Israel must learn how to work.

cue0150826
01:10:06.100 --> 01:10:08.100
Now, we're talking about these people.

cue0150827
01:10:08.100 --> 01:10:14.100
Now, in the early times, already speaking about Zionism.

cue0150828
01:10:14.100 --> 01:10:16.459
But now comes Rabbi Shaimon Shehazan,

cue0150829
01:10:16.459 --> 01:10:21.700
and he comes up with an idea which is absolutely new.

cue0150830
01:10:21.700 --> 01:10:27.500
The idea was, let us organize ourselves and buy land

cue0150831
01:10:27.500 --> 01:10:30.660
from the Arabs in Erez Israel.

cue0150832
01:10:30.660 --> 01:10:37.339
The first person ever to speak about buying the land

cue0150833
01:10:37.339 --> 01:10:47.580
in Erez Israel from the Arabs was in 1858,

cue0150834
01:10:47.580 --> 01:10:50.299
26 years before Shapira, because always

cue0150835
01:10:50.299 --> 01:10:52.899
say Shapira is the first person.

cue0150836
01:10:52.899 --> 01:10:56.979
And 39 years before the first Zionist Congress.

cue0150837
01:10:56.979 --> 01:11:00.540
Rabbi Shehazan pleaded with European Jewish to establish,

cue0150838
01:11:00.540 --> 01:11:03.220
you know how he called the place, this organization

cue0150839
01:11:03.220 --> 01:11:07.299
to collect money for Israel?

cue0150840
01:11:07.299 --> 01:11:09.180
How did he call it?

cue0150841
01:11:09.180 --> 01:11:11.660
Keren Kayemet.

cue0150842
01:11:11.660 --> 01:11:14.740
And what is very shameful, Keren Kayemet,

cue0150843
01:11:14.740 --> 01:11:20.939
what is very shameful is that modern historians,

cue0150844
01:11:20.939 --> 01:11:24.060
Jewish modern historians, they overlook this.

cue0150845
01:11:24.060 --> 01:11:27.379
They always say Keren Kayemet was founded by Shapira.

cue0150846
01:11:27.379 --> 01:11:28.100
That's not true.

cue0150847
01:11:28.100 --> 01:11:31.379
Keren Kayemet was founded by Rabbi Shehazan.

cue0150848
01:11:31.379 --> 01:11:34.339
And it says Keren Kayemet for the purpose

cue0150849
01:11:34.339 --> 01:11:39.100
of purchasing property in the Hebrew, in the Holy Land.

cue0150850
01:11:39.100 --> 01:11:41.819
Keren Kayemet, that's right.

cue0150851
01:11:41.819 --> 01:11:46.859
He is the one who established these things.

cue0150852
01:11:46.859 --> 01:11:49.299
Now, one last point.

cue0150853
01:11:49.299 --> 01:11:53.020
And with this, I think I finish what I have to tell you.

cue0150854
01:11:53.700 --> 01:12:06.700
Not only that he started with a whole movement of raising money

cue0150855
01:12:06.700 --> 01:12:10.819
for buying land in Israel, and also speaking

cue0150856
01:12:10.819 --> 01:12:17.060
about the need for the Jew to have a military arm,

cue0150857
01:12:17.060 --> 01:12:20.580
and become in a sense a nation, but also

cue0150858
01:12:20.620 --> 01:12:26.220
start speaking with the wealthy Sepharadi families

cue0150859
01:12:26.220 --> 01:12:30.020
to come and establish themselves in Erez Yiśraʾel.

cue0150860
01:12:30.020 --> 01:12:33.220
One of the most important things that we must remember

cue0150861
01:12:33.220 --> 01:12:35.020
is the following.

cue0150862
01:12:35.020 --> 01:12:41.379
Those who came to Erez Yiśraʾel from ʾAshkenaz, by and large,

cue0150863
01:12:41.379 --> 01:12:46.580
belong to the poorest elements of the society.

cue0150864
01:12:46.580 --> 01:12:48.620
Sepharadim who came to Erez Yiśraʾel,

cue0150865
01:12:48.620 --> 01:12:51.939
I want to mention a few names, yes,

cue0150866
01:12:51.939 --> 01:12:56.299
where they came from the wealthiest Sepharadi families.

cue0150867
01:12:56.299 --> 01:13:00.700
They came and established themselves in Erez Yiśraʾel.

cue0150868
01:13:00.700 --> 01:13:05.660
Just let me mention, for instance, the Nahum family.

cue0150869
01:13:05.660 --> 01:13:08.299
The Nahum, for instance, he was the one

cue0150870
01:13:08.299 --> 01:13:16.259
who owned the railroad from Haifa to Egypt, all right?

cue0150871
01:13:16.259 --> 01:13:18.979
From Haifa to Egypt, the railroad

cue0150872
01:13:18.979 --> 01:13:22.459
belonged to Senor Nahum.

cue0150873
01:13:22.459 --> 01:13:23.540
What is his first name?

cue0150874
01:13:23.540 --> 01:13:25.700
It is the son of Ha-Ha-Ma-Tov.

cue0150875
01:13:25.700 --> 01:13:26.779
He has his name in Hebrew.

cue0150876
01:13:26.779 --> 01:13:28.540
What is his name in Hebrew?

cue0150877
01:13:28.540 --> 01:13:30.740
I forgot his name.

cue0150878
01:13:30.740 --> 01:13:31.620
I forgot the name.

cue0150879
01:13:31.620 --> 01:13:34.540
It's not related to the Sheikh Rabbi?

cue0150880
01:13:34.540 --> 01:13:36.500
No, a different Nahum.

cue0150881
01:13:36.500 --> 01:13:39.060
I mean, maybe they were related, but it's a different Nahum.

cue0150882
01:13:39.060 --> 01:13:41.979
This Nahum, he was actually also originally from?

cue0150883
01:13:41.979 --> 01:13:42.479
Turkey?

cue0150884
01:13:42.479 --> 01:13:42.979
From?

cue0150885
01:13:42.979 --> 01:13:43.479
No.

cue0150886
01:13:43.479 --> 01:13:44.339
Istanbul?

cue0150887
01:13:44.339 --> 01:13:51.500
No, this Nahum was from Tripoli, Libya, yes?

cue0150888
01:13:51.500 --> 01:13:53.700
Then came to Egypt, and then he was

cue0150889
01:13:53.700 --> 01:13:55.459
one of the persons that went there.

cue0150890
01:13:55.459 --> 01:13:57.459
Also, for instance, the famous Yehuda family,

cue0150891
01:13:57.459 --> 01:14:02.220
from the Sasson family, from Baghdad.

cue0150892
01:14:02.220 --> 01:14:04.979
Angel, Shemaya Angel, from Damascus,

cue0150893
01:14:04.979 --> 01:14:07.580
was from the wealthiest Jews.

cue0150894
01:14:07.580 --> 01:14:10.899
Many of the wealthiest Jews, yes,

cue0150895
01:14:10.899 --> 01:14:15.060
come to establish themselves, the Abu'l-Afiyah, the angels,

cue0150896
01:14:15.060 --> 01:14:15.580
and so on.

cue0150897
01:14:15.580 --> 01:14:19.060
As a matter of fact, you must know the following.

cue0150898
01:14:19.060 --> 01:14:23.660
We speak about pioneering in Zionism.

cue0150899
01:14:23.660 --> 01:14:26.060
There are two kinds of Zionism.

cue0150900
01:14:26.060 --> 01:14:32.259
There are the agricultural Zionism.

cue0150901
01:14:32.259 --> 01:14:34.620
And on this desk in Azzim, they did a lot.

cue0150902
01:14:34.620 --> 01:14:37.180
But the urban Zionism, the ones who

cue0150903
01:14:37.180 --> 01:14:40.899
established themselves in the cities and revived the cities,

cue0150904
01:14:40.899 --> 01:14:44.459
like Tiberias, Safed, Jerusalem, Tel Aviv, and so on,

cue0150905
01:14:44.459 --> 01:14:46.100
these were Sepharadim.

cue0150906
01:14:46.100 --> 01:14:49.899
They were ancient people who came to Israel

cue0150907
01:14:49.899 --> 01:14:52.540
with a lot of money.

cue0150908
01:14:52.540 --> 01:14:55.419
They were very wealthy Jews, and came,

cue0150909
01:14:55.419 --> 01:14:58.459
they settled in Israel, and they helped, of course,

cue0150910
01:14:58.459 --> 01:15:00.819
all the Jews, including ʾAshkenaz Jews,

cue0150911
01:15:00.819 --> 01:15:05.660
and the Zionists, and so on, to flourish.

cue0150912
01:15:05.660 --> 01:15:09.620
Let me make a summary of everything I said.

cue0150913
01:15:12.540 --> 01:15:19.819
We have a long history, the Jews, of light and shadow.

cue0150914
01:15:19.819 --> 01:15:26.060
We have light, like Al-Ambam, and then,

cue0150915
01:15:26.060 --> 01:15:29.020
for reasons that only a psychologist could tell us,

cue0150916
01:15:29.020 --> 01:15:31.060
we like to self-destruct.

cue0150917
01:15:31.060 --> 01:15:35.580
And then we have anti-Maimonides.

cue0150918
01:15:35.580 --> 01:15:37.020
In the process of anti-Maimonides,

cue0150919
01:15:37.020 --> 01:15:39.459
we destroyed all the communities in the West, and so on.

cue0150920
01:15:39.459 --> 01:15:42.620
Expulsion from Spain, Jews are divided, and so on.

cue0150921
01:15:42.620 --> 01:15:45.220
But I say in Arabic,

cue0150922
01:15:45.220 --> 01:15:51.540
Tlalav Me'etna, Me'etna, you know, with it.

cue0150923
01:15:51.540 --> 01:15:57.299
After this, another renaissance, and that renaissance

cue0150924
01:15:57.299 --> 01:15:59.500
is made by Maran, and the whole school of Maran.

cue0150925
01:16:00.419 --> 01:16:07.259
Law, communities, so on, study qabbala,

cue0150926
01:16:07.259 --> 01:16:10.339
study Talmud, and all these type of things.

cue0150927
01:16:10.339 --> 01:16:16.740
And then again, with Shabbatai Sevi, we self-destruct.

cue0150928
01:16:16.740 --> 01:16:21.740
Total destruction, total destruction of the...

cue0150929
01:16:21.740 --> 01:16:28.939
Now, when we come to the 1800s, I want you to understand,

cue0150930
01:16:28.939 --> 01:16:32.259
to be a Jew was a very difficult thing.

cue0150931
01:16:32.259 --> 01:16:35.939
On the one hand, it was embarrassing.

cue0150932
01:16:35.939 --> 01:16:42.100
Many of the chapters produced by the Shabbatai Sevi movement

cue0150933
01:16:42.100 --> 01:16:45.540
were horrible things that were done in the name of religion.

cue0150934
01:16:45.540 --> 01:16:49.140
Not by Goyim, but by us.

cue0150935
01:16:49.140 --> 01:16:53.620
Jews lost trust in the tradition,

cue0150936
01:16:53.620 --> 01:16:55.660
lost trust in their institutions,

cue0150937
01:16:55.660 --> 01:16:59.259
lost trust in their rabbis.

cue0150938
01:16:59.259 --> 01:17:04.379
There were people, good intentions, bad intentions,

cue0150939
01:17:04.379 --> 01:17:09.700
that they tried to establish new ideologies.

cue0150940
01:17:09.700 --> 01:17:13.379
Moses Mendelssohn, that is one.

cue0150941
01:17:13.379 --> 01:17:18.580
And that's very attractive, because you could be a Jew,

cue0150942
01:17:18.580 --> 01:17:20.779
and you act like a Goy.

cue0150943
01:17:20.779 --> 01:17:23.660
You act like a little Goy, you know?

cue0150944
01:17:23.660 --> 01:17:26.660
America, yeah, you could eat Ankosha outside the house,

cue0150945
01:17:26.660 --> 01:17:29.379
and you could do anything you want to, you know?

cue0150946
01:17:29.379 --> 01:17:32.339
And at the same time, you don't convert, you know?

cue0150947
01:17:32.339 --> 01:17:37.459
And you have access, you have access to the political,

cue0150948
01:17:37.459 --> 01:17:43.060
social, and economic establishment of the country.

cue0150949
01:17:43.060 --> 01:17:45.100
What is the other alternative?

cue0150950
01:17:45.100 --> 01:17:49.060
The other alternative is the orthodox world.

cue0150951
01:17:49.060 --> 01:17:53.379
The orthodox world, you say, well, it's fine.

cue0150952
01:17:53.379 --> 01:17:56.140
But it secludes you.

cue0150953
01:17:56.140 --> 01:17:58.939
You cannot participate in commerce.

cue0150954
01:17:58.939 --> 01:18:02.180
You cannot participate in the academic,

cue0150955
01:18:02.180 --> 01:18:05.419
in the values, what's going on around society.

cue0150956
01:18:05.419 --> 01:18:08.140
You cannot understand what's going on around you.

cue0150957
01:18:08.140 --> 01:18:10.899
You cannot have an intelligent life.

cue0150958
01:18:10.899 --> 01:18:14.779
And that's very difficult.

cue0150959
01:18:14.779 --> 01:18:18.700
The worst part about it, Jew was transformed

cue0150960
01:18:18.700 --> 01:18:21.979
from a member of the Jewish nation

cue0150961
01:18:21.979 --> 01:18:24.540
to a member of our religion.

cue0150962
01:18:24.540 --> 01:18:29.939
And as a religion, we eventually, we will disappear.

cue0150963
01:18:29.939 --> 01:18:33.020
No more roots towards Israel.

cue0150964
01:18:33.020 --> 01:18:34.259
What to do?

cue0150965
01:18:34.259 --> 01:18:35.580
What to do?

cue0150966
01:18:35.580 --> 01:18:37.859
That was the great point.

cue0150967
01:18:37.859 --> 01:18:41.100
Here we are, when we have the Sepharadi tradition

cue0150968
01:18:41.100 --> 01:18:44.859
comes about, comes one more time.

cue0150969
01:18:44.859 --> 01:18:47.140
What, how does it come about?

cue0150970
01:18:47.140 --> 01:18:52.979
Well, the understanding, first of all, that we need unity.

cue0150971
01:18:52.979 --> 01:18:57.500
And that this unity is going to come, not through religion,

cue0150972
01:18:57.500 --> 01:19:00.020
because Jews were separated already by religion.

cue0150973
01:19:00.020 --> 01:19:04.859
Reform, conservative, orthodox, secularist.

cue0150974
01:19:04.859 --> 01:19:07.020
So how to bring unity for the Jew?

cue0150975
01:19:07.020 --> 01:19:10.419
How to foster unity among the Jews?

cue0150976
01:19:10.419 --> 01:19:12.939
And here comes the genius of Rabbi Shemot Shahazan.

cue0150977
01:19:12.939 --> 01:19:15.939
And then his followers, Rabbi Shemot Shahazan,

cue0150978
01:19:15.939 --> 01:19:17.979
wrote in English, wrote in English,

cue0150979
01:19:17.979 --> 01:19:19.979
wrote in many languages.

cue0150980
01:19:19.979 --> 01:19:22.660
First in England, he came.

cue0150981
01:19:22.660 --> 01:19:25.180
His idea, the idea of Rabbi Shemot Shahazan

cue0150982
01:19:25.180 --> 01:19:29.020
was to speak with the Reformed synagogue

cue0150983
01:19:29.020 --> 01:19:31.859
and to make him the Hazovitchua, at least

cue0150984
01:19:31.859 --> 01:19:34.500
to participate in the political part.

cue0150985
01:19:34.500 --> 01:19:36.819
And he came especially for this reason.

cue0150986
01:19:36.819 --> 01:19:39.899
And so the idea of speaking Hebrew.

cue0150987
01:19:39.899 --> 01:19:42.859
Before Rabbi Shemot Shahazan, nobody

cue0150988
01:19:42.859 --> 01:19:49.779
thought that Hebrew could be spoken.

cue0150989
01:19:49.779 --> 01:19:51.419
You must remember that Hebrew were not

cue0150990
01:19:51.419 --> 01:19:56.419
spoken for 3,000 years, maybe, or 2,500 years.

cue0150991
01:19:56.419 --> 01:20:01.020
And the genius of Rabbi Shemot Shahazan

cue0150992
01:20:01.020 --> 01:20:10.379
is to discover that Hebrew could become an efficient link

cue0150993
01:20:10.379 --> 01:20:12.379
between all Jews.

cue0150994
01:20:12.379 --> 01:20:17.500
We heard these two young ladies, Grace Aguilar and Abarbanel

cue0150995
01:20:17.500 --> 01:20:23.140
Lindo, saying that Hebrew is going to become

cue0150996
01:20:23.140 --> 01:20:25.299
the language spoken by all.

cue0150997
01:20:25.299 --> 01:20:26.140
Yes?

cue0150998
01:20:26.140 --> 01:20:29.899
In your nation, you could come from Austria, or from Spain,

cue0150999
01:20:29.899 --> 01:20:31.939
or from England, you speak different languages.

cue0151000
01:20:31.939 --> 01:20:33.939
How are you going to unite?

cue0151001
01:20:33.939 --> 01:20:35.379
Speak Hebrew.

cue0151002
01:20:35.379 --> 01:20:39.180
For this, they proposed a change of the curriculum.

cue0151003
01:20:39.939 --> 01:20:42.140
Yes.

cue0151004
01:20:42.140 --> 01:20:44.100
And the most important change in the curriculum

cue0151005
01:20:44.100 --> 01:20:48.020
was that you do not begin by explaining

cue0151006
01:20:48.020 --> 01:20:50.740
to a child the meaning of the sedur,

cue0151007
01:20:50.740 --> 01:20:53.259
or the meaning of the Talmud.

cue0151008
01:20:53.259 --> 01:20:58.620
Not because there's too complex an idea to understand.

cue0151009
01:20:58.620 --> 01:21:00.660
But the first thing you have to teach the child

cue0151010
01:21:00.660 --> 01:21:03.339
is to speak Hebrew.

cue0151011
01:21:03.339 --> 01:21:05.859
Teach him the language.

cue0151012
01:21:05.859 --> 01:21:08.459
And once that he knows the language,

cue0151013
01:21:08.459 --> 01:21:12.939
he will be able to understand the sedur, the Ḥumash,

cue0151014
01:21:12.939 --> 01:21:15.580
the Talmud, the Mishna, whatever it is.

cue0151015
01:21:15.580 --> 01:21:17.299
That was a revolution.

cue0151016
01:21:17.299 --> 01:21:18.899
And for this, established schools.

cue0151017
01:21:18.899 --> 01:21:21.100
By the way, in one of my articles,

cue0151018
01:21:21.100 --> 01:21:25.140
I point out that when Adler, but eventually Shemot Shahazan

cue0151019
01:21:25.140 --> 01:21:28.060
comes also, even goes up to Alexandria.

cue0151020
01:21:28.060 --> 01:21:30.740
And he becomes a Rabbi in Alexandria.

cue0151021
01:21:30.740 --> 01:21:35.339
And when Adler, a very famous British Jew,

cue0151022
01:21:35.339 --> 01:21:42.259
comes to Egypt, and he sees the Kolkatawi,

cue0151023
01:21:42.259 --> 01:21:44.020
from the famous Katawi family.

cue0151024
01:21:44.020 --> 01:21:44.899
Yes.

cue0151025
01:21:44.899 --> 01:21:47.419
He says, he was so impressed with that school.

cue0151026
01:21:47.419 --> 01:21:50.180
He said, we should have schools like this even in England.

cue0151027
01:21:50.180 --> 01:21:53.299
Become model schools where Hebrew was taught,

cue0151028
01:21:53.299 --> 01:21:55.259
and the languages were taught.

cue0151029
01:21:55.259 --> 01:21:56.660
You did not only spoke Hebrew.

cue0151030
01:21:56.660 --> 01:22:00.459
You also, you know how to speak French, or Italian, or English.

cue0151031
01:22:00.459 --> 01:22:03.700
And the child came out with a Jewish education.

cue0151032
01:22:03.700 --> 01:22:04.220
Yes.

cue0151033
01:22:04.220 --> 01:22:07.540
And at the same time, was a cosmopolitan individual.

cue0151034
01:22:07.540 --> 01:22:11.220
My grandfather tell me that when he was in the Katawi,

cue0151035
01:22:11.220 --> 01:22:14.259
not only he knew how to speak, of course, Arabic,

cue0151036
01:22:14.259 --> 01:22:16.459
of course, he knew Ladino, but also he knew French.

cue0151037
01:22:16.459 --> 01:22:17.339
He knew Turkish.

cue0151038
01:22:17.339 --> 01:22:19.299
You know, he said he could write an invoice.

cue0151039
01:22:19.299 --> 01:22:21.779
I don't know how many languages he could write an invoice.

cue0151040
01:22:21.779 --> 01:22:23.339
Because they taught him how to write

cue0151041
01:22:23.339 --> 01:22:28.339
Turkish, and Arabic, and Hebrew, and French, and so on.

cue0151042
01:22:28.339 --> 01:22:29.379
They're people they knew.

cue0151043
01:22:29.379 --> 01:22:30.500
They became polyglots.

cue0151044
01:22:30.500 --> 01:22:31.500
They know how to speak.

cue0151045
01:22:31.500 --> 01:22:33.339
They know how to express themselves.

cue0151046
01:22:33.339 --> 01:22:34.500
And therefore, they hide it.

cue0151047
01:22:34.500 --> 01:22:38.779
But the most important language for us was the Hebrew language.

cue0151048
01:22:38.779 --> 01:22:40.180
Second idea.

cue0151049
01:22:40.180 --> 01:22:42.379
Second idea.

cue0151050
01:22:42.379 --> 01:22:44.899
Always, until today, I'm telling you,

cue0151051
01:22:44.899 --> 01:22:47.299
I feel embarrassed to do that.

cue0151052
01:22:47.299 --> 01:22:50.220
The Jews, somehow, they want to present themselves

cue0151053
01:22:50.220 --> 01:22:53.339
as another version of Virgin Mary.

cue0151054
01:22:53.339 --> 01:22:54.700
We don't touch weapons.

cue0151055
01:22:54.700 --> 01:22:56.500
No, weapons, no.

cue0151056
01:22:56.500 --> 01:22:57.419
No military.

cue0151057
01:22:57.419 --> 01:22:59.180
The Jews, not the military.

cue0151058
01:22:59.180 --> 01:23:02.740
And Rabbi said, Rabbi, Rabbi, Rabbi says, we are a military.

cue0151059
01:23:02.740 --> 01:23:07.700
If we have no military bases, we cannot have ʾEreṣ Israel.

cue0151060
01:23:07.700 --> 01:23:08.419
Yes?

cue0151061
01:23:08.419 --> 01:23:12.140
Look at the today in Bosnia.

cue0151062
01:23:12.140 --> 01:23:14.259
The people said, we conquered the land.

cue0151063
01:23:14.259 --> 01:23:16.540
Well, I'm going to give it to the Turks back.

cue0151064
01:23:16.540 --> 01:23:17.899
Forget about it.

cue0151065
01:23:17.899 --> 01:23:20.740
We conquered this land.

cue0151066
01:23:20.740 --> 01:23:21.899
We took this land.

cue0151067
01:23:21.899 --> 01:23:23.979
Who is going to take it away from us?

cue0151068
01:23:23.979 --> 01:23:26.419
You come to us Americans, we're going to fight you.

cue0151069
01:23:26.419 --> 01:23:27.259
We fight you in America.

cue0151070
01:23:27.259 --> 01:23:28.220
We fight you in London.

cue0151071
01:23:28.220 --> 01:23:29.459
We fight you in Paris.

cue0151072
01:23:29.459 --> 01:23:31.379
Everybody keeps quiet.

cue0151073
01:23:31.459 --> 01:23:33.459
The simple thing is this.

cue0151074
01:23:33.459 --> 01:23:35.339
We took this land by arm.

cue0151075
01:23:35.339 --> 01:23:37.740
What do you want from us?

cue0151076
01:23:37.740 --> 01:23:44.299
The whole complex that is eyed for us to take a land by arm,

cue0151077
01:23:44.299 --> 01:23:46.020
it comes from Moshe Mendelsohn.

cue0151078
01:23:46.020 --> 01:23:48.299
It comes from this stupidity of this.

cue0151079
01:23:48.299 --> 01:23:50.540
It comes from Shabbatai Tzvi, that somehow, we're

cue0151080
01:23:50.540 --> 01:23:54.060
going to change the world by making tikkunim,

cue0151081
01:23:54.060 --> 01:23:56.859
I don't know, changing the, no.

cue0151082
01:23:56.859 --> 01:23:59.220
This is what Rabbi says.

cue0151083
01:23:59.220 --> 01:24:02.459
We have to teach the children military,

cue0151084
01:24:02.459 --> 01:24:06.379
and they have to do it by military means.

cue0151085
01:24:06.379 --> 01:24:11.939
At that time, it was a revolutionary idea.

cue0151086
01:24:11.939 --> 01:24:15.939
And last but not least, the establishment

cue0151087
01:24:15.939 --> 01:24:23.259
of a keren kayemet, a trust fund for Jews

cue0151088
01:24:23.259 --> 01:24:25.259
to purchase land all over.

cue0151089
01:24:25.259 --> 01:24:27.060
But he didn't want only to purchase land.

cue0151090
01:24:27.060 --> 01:24:28.939
If I tell you what he wanted with the money,

cue0151091
01:24:29.140 --> 01:24:30.060
it's extraordinary.

cue0151092
01:24:30.060 --> 01:24:30.939
You won't believe it.

cue0151093
01:24:30.939 --> 01:24:34.859
These people were so, so ahead of their time

cue0151094
01:24:34.859 --> 01:24:38.740
that it's simply amazing.

cue0151095
01:24:38.740 --> 01:24:44.419
If I have it, I don't have it here.

cue0151096
01:24:44.419 --> 01:24:46.060
All right, maybe I'm lucky.

cue0151097
01:24:46.060 --> 01:24:47.459
Maybe, maybe I have it.

cue0151098
01:24:47.459 --> 01:24:49.740
Wait, can you wait for a few seconds?

cue0151099
01:24:49.740 --> 01:24:53.419
Let's see if I find it.

cue0151100
01:24:53.419 --> 01:24:54.500
Do you have a few seconds?

cue0151101
01:24:55.419 --> 01:24:55.919
No.

cue0151102
01:25:00.180 --> 01:25:02.100
I'll tell you what he wanted with the money.

cue0151103
01:25:02.100 --> 01:25:06.419
He wanted with the money to send children to school,

cue0151104
01:25:06.419 --> 01:25:09.259
to have representatives in different governments

cue0151105
01:25:09.259 --> 01:25:11.979
to speak on behalf of the Jewish causes.

cue0151106
01:25:11.979 --> 01:25:14.339
And he wanted money, the same with the money,

cue0151107
01:25:14.339 --> 01:25:23.979
with the keren kayemet, also to establish agricultural schools

cue0151108
01:25:23.979 --> 01:25:27.500
to teach the children how to plant the land.

cue0151109
01:25:27.500 --> 01:25:32.140
By the way, in this country, people don't know.

cue0151110
01:25:32.140 --> 01:25:34.180
People don't know.

cue0151111
01:25:34.180 --> 01:25:36.100
There was Judah Turo.

cue0151112
01:25:36.100 --> 01:25:37.299
You heard of Judah Turo?

cue0151113
01:25:41.859 --> 01:25:50.979
Judah Turo was born 1775, died 1854.

cue0151114
01:25:50.979 --> 01:25:52.660
He was one of the persons who responded

cue0151115
01:25:52.660 --> 01:25:55.660
to the call of Rabbi Seyed Moshe Ḥazzan to give money.

cue0151116
01:25:55.660 --> 01:25:59.660
At that time, it was an enormous money, $10,000, $10,000.

cue0151117
01:25:59.660 --> 01:26:02.220
He was one of the founders of Spanish and Portuguesia,

cue0151118
01:26:02.220 --> 01:26:03.740
a very, very wealthy Jew.

cue0151119
01:26:03.740 --> 01:26:05.419
And he died without children.

cue0151120
01:26:05.419 --> 01:26:08.339
And part of the money he gave to Rabbi Seyed Moshe Ḥazzan,

cue0151121
01:26:08.339 --> 01:26:10.140
to the cause of Rabbi Seyed Moshe Ḥazzan,

cue0151122
01:26:10.140 --> 01:26:15.500
to establish agricultural schools in Israel.

cue0151123
01:26:15.500 --> 01:26:21.140
Another person, if you're an American and you're a Sepharadi,

cue0151124
01:26:21.140 --> 01:26:22.660
you have a lot to be proud of.

cue0151125
01:26:22.660 --> 01:26:27.339
One of the great novelists and theater playwriters

cue0151126
01:26:27.339 --> 01:26:32.220
and spokesmen in America was Mordecai Noaḥ.

cue0151127
01:26:32.220 --> 01:26:33.979
His last name was Noaḥ.

cue0151128
01:26:33.979 --> 01:26:35.899
He was a Sepharadi Jew.

cue0151129
01:26:35.899 --> 01:26:38.220
We have in Beth-Neh-Wah.

cue0151130
01:26:38.220 --> 01:26:39.859
You know, you heard Beth-Neh-Wah?

cue0151131
01:26:39.859 --> 01:26:41.740
Neh-Wah and Noaḥ, all right?

cue0151132
01:26:41.740 --> 01:26:44.779
Now, just let me tell you.

cue0151133
01:26:44.779 --> 01:26:48.100
Now, Mordecai Noaḥ.

cue0151134
01:26:48.100 --> 01:26:54.419
Yes, Mordecai Noaḥ died, was 1785, 1851.

cue0151135
01:26:54.419 --> 01:27:03.140
He bought a piece of land around Buffalo.

cue0151136
01:27:03.140 --> 01:27:04.220
Buffalo.

cue0151137
01:27:04.220 --> 01:27:05.580
What he wanted with the land.

cue0151138
01:27:05.580 --> 01:27:07.060
Did you know about that?

cue0151139
01:27:07.060 --> 01:27:07.859
Famous thing.

cue0151140
01:27:07.859 --> 01:27:10.140
He bought a piece of land in Buffalo.

cue0151141
01:27:10.140 --> 01:27:13.620
And he wanted the Jews to come, the Jews from Europe,

cue0151142
01:27:13.620 --> 01:27:15.259
to Buffalo.

cue0151143
01:27:15.259 --> 01:27:17.339
What for?

cue0151144
01:27:17.339 --> 01:27:18.819
Genius idea.

cue0151145
01:27:18.819 --> 01:27:24.299
To teach them agriculture and then send them

cue0151146
01:27:24.299 --> 01:27:25.500
back to ʾEreṣ Yiśraʾel.

cue0151147
01:27:28.500 --> 01:27:31.100
Mordecai Noaḥ.

cue0151148
01:27:31.100 --> 01:27:32.339
He wrote many plays.

cue0151149
01:27:32.339 --> 01:27:34.700
He was also a newspaper.

cue0151150
01:27:34.700 --> 01:27:37.100
He wrote articles for the newspaper and so on.

cue0151151
01:27:37.100 --> 01:27:41.899
And he wanted, again, influenced by Rabbi Zion Moshe Ḥazzan.

cue0151152
01:27:41.899 --> 01:27:45.419
Bought a piece of land in Buffalo

cue0151153
01:27:45.419 --> 01:27:47.580
with the intention of bringing Jews

cue0151154
01:27:47.580 --> 01:27:50.859
from all over the backward countries,

cue0151155
01:27:50.859 --> 01:27:54.419
teach them, train them into the art of agriculture,

cue0151156
01:27:54.419 --> 01:27:58.540
the science, and then send them to ʾEreṣ Yiśraʾel.

cue0151157
01:27:58.540 --> 01:28:10.500
So in this way, Sepharadim tried to cope with the modern times.

cue0151158
01:28:10.500 --> 01:28:13.220
Did we succeed?

cue0151159
01:28:13.220 --> 01:28:14.540
Did we fail?

cue0151160
01:28:14.540 --> 01:28:16.819
I really believe that we failed.

cue0151161
01:28:16.819 --> 01:28:21.500
In one sense, we failed because our ideas, unfortunately,

cue0151162
01:28:21.500 --> 01:28:23.979
were not carried by us.

cue0151163
01:28:23.979 --> 01:28:27.100
Our ideas, later on, were carried

cue0151164
01:28:27.100 --> 01:28:29.180
by the ʾAshkenaz community.

cue0151165
01:28:29.180 --> 01:28:31.100
That was very, very nice.

cue0151166
01:28:31.100 --> 01:28:35.379
But we no longer participated in our own ideas.

cue0151167
01:28:35.379 --> 01:28:39.339
And unfortunately, in that sense, we did fail.

cue0151168
01:28:39.339 --> 01:28:43.500
Although I believe that we helped, in a very strong way,

cue0151169
01:28:43.500 --> 01:28:48.060
shaped the modern world.

cue0151170
01:28:48.060 --> 01:28:51.740
We claim that there is an alternative

cue0151171
01:28:51.740 --> 01:28:56.060
to both the orthodox and the reform movements.

cue0151172
01:28:56.060 --> 01:28:59.060
We also claim that there is a need

cue0151173
01:28:59.060 --> 01:29:03.459
for revitalizing the political dimension of Israel,

cue0151174
01:29:03.459 --> 01:29:04.740
of the Jewish people.

cue0151175
01:29:04.740 --> 01:29:08.100
And we believe that we must find something.

cue0151176
01:29:08.100 --> 01:29:09.979
We thought that the Hebrew language that

cue0151177
01:29:10.060 --> 01:29:12.620
should serve as a link for every Jew,

cue0151178
01:29:12.620 --> 01:29:15.580
regardless of his or her ideology.

cue0151179
01:29:15.580 --> 01:29:16.180
We did this.

cue0151180
01:29:16.180 --> 01:29:18.620
I think that in that sense, our ideas

cue0151181
01:29:18.620 --> 01:29:21.180
succeeded, although we ourselves,

cue0151182
01:29:21.180 --> 01:29:23.859
for reasons which are too painful to discuss,

cue0151183
01:29:23.859 --> 01:29:29.020
we did not manage to carry on those ideas.

cue0151184
01:29:29.020 --> 01:29:30.580
So that's about it.

cue0151185
01:29:30.580 --> 01:29:32.339
Now we finish with a series of lectures,

cue0151186
01:29:32.339 --> 01:29:34.339
no more lectures on the subject.

cue0151187
01:29:34.339 --> 01:29:39.299
But after Shaḇuʿot, we're going to have classes.

cue0151188
01:29:39.299 --> 01:29:41.459
Yes, Tuesday night, we're going to have, I think,

cue0151189
01:29:41.459 --> 01:29:42.899
one or two more classes.

cue0151190
01:29:42.899 --> 01:29:46.580
One of it is about the destruction of the temple,

cue0151191
01:29:46.580 --> 01:29:48.220
which is going to be very interesting.

cue0151192
01:29:48.220 --> 01:29:50.520
And another one, I don't know about some other subject,

cue0151193
01:29:50.520 --> 01:29:51.939
which I did not think of yet.

cue0151194
01:29:51.939 --> 01:29:55.779
So there are going to be two other classes after Shaḇuʿot.

cue0151195
01:29:55.779 --> 01:29:56.779
Try to come.

cue0151196
01:29:56.779 --> 01:29:58.660
Enjoy your holiday.

cue0151197
01:29:58.660 --> 01:30:02.060
And it was really, I enjoyed myself

cue0151198
01:30:02.060 --> 01:30:03.740
discussing those ideas with you.

cue0151199
01:30:03.740 --> 01:30:06.100
I hope that you have a better grasp

cue0151200
01:30:06.100 --> 01:30:10.299
of your own roots and the identity, the Jewish identity.

cue0151201
01:30:10.299 --> 01:30:10.799
Yes?

cue0151202
01:30:10.799 --> 01:30:11.459
Quick question.

cue0151203
01:30:11.459 --> 01:30:13.859
Can you spend a minute of your own thoughts?

cue0151204
01:30:13.859 --> 01:30:19.180
My own thoughts is that Sepharadim and ʾAshkenaz,

cue0151205
01:30:19.180 --> 01:30:21.819
what I'm going to say is going to sound a little bit this.

cue0151206
01:30:21.819 --> 01:30:25.779
They're going to be history in 80 years from now.

cue0151207
01:30:25.779 --> 01:30:30.020
That in 80 years from now, 80 years from now, 70, 50,

cue0151208
01:30:30.020 --> 01:30:32.140
say, they're going to be.

cue0151209
01:30:32.140 --> 01:30:35.899
A new kind of a Jew is going to emerge.

cue0151210
01:30:35.899 --> 01:30:39.500
And that is going to be the Jew of East Israel.

cue0151211
01:30:39.500 --> 01:30:40.700
It's a different kind of Jew.

cue0151212
01:30:40.700 --> 01:30:42.100
It's not going to be Sepharadim.

cue0151213
01:30:42.100 --> 01:30:43.859
It's not going to be ʾAshkenaz.

cue0151214
01:30:43.859 --> 01:30:47.779
It's going to maybe take some of the best of both sides.

cue0151215
01:30:47.779 --> 01:30:51.500
But a new kind of Jew will emerge.

cue0151216
01:30:51.500 --> 01:30:55.299
And also, I believe, and I hope I'm wrong,

cue0151217
01:30:55.299 --> 01:30:58.020
but I do believe that there is not a future.

cue0151218
01:30:58.020 --> 01:31:00.859
There is no future for Jew outside East Israel.

cue0151219
01:31:00.859 --> 01:31:05.979
In America, we are losing over 55% to intermarriage.

cue0151220
01:31:05.979 --> 01:31:10.700
And for me, that is as bad as losing 55%

cue0151221
01:31:10.700 --> 01:31:12.379
by being in a concentration camp,

cue0151222
01:31:12.379 --> 01:31:14.140
because we lose them forever.

cue0151223
01:31:14.140 --> 01:31:17.140
In South America, it's the whole us again thing.

cue0151224
01:31:17.140 --> 01:31:21.899
And I do think that the Jew that will emerge

cue0151225
01:31:21.899 --> 01:31:24.020
will be the Jew in East Israel.

cue0151226
01:31:24.020 --> 01:31:26.180
Will no longer be Sepharadim, ʾAshkenaz.

cue0151227
01:31:26.220 --> 01:31:28.220
It will be Yehudi.

cue0151228
01:31:31.620 --> 01:31:37.020
I tell you, I tell you, on the one hand,

cue0151229
01:31:37.020 --> 01:31:40.020
I do believe in the Tora very strongly.

cue0151230
01:31:40.020 --> 01:31:42.180
But also, I do believe that the Tora is not

cue0151231
01:31:42.180 --> 01:31:45.459
only to put Antiphilim, which we believe in Antiphilim

cue0151232
01:31:45.459 --> 01:31:48.299
in Yitikasher, but also there are political duties.

cue0151233
01:31:48.299 --> 01:31:49.779
There's political responsibilities.

cue0151234
01:31:49.779 --> 01:31:51.220
There are social responsibilities.

cue0151235
01:31:51.220 --> 01:31:53.140
And we cannot just choose.

cue0151236
01:31:53.140 --> 01:31:54.140
Some must vote.

cue0151237
01:31:54.140 --> 01:31:56.220
I'll give you a simple example, in which I totally

cue0151238
01:31:56.220 --> 01:31:58.419
disagree with the Orthodox.

cue0151239
01:31:58.419 --> 01:32:00.299
We have 630 commandments.

cue0151240
01:32:00.299 --> 01:32:02.620
One of the commandments is to defend ʾEreṣ Yiśraʾel.

cue0151241
01:32:06.899 --> 01:32:08.779
I, as an Orthodox Jew, I say I'm not

cue0151242
01:32:08.779 --> 01:32:11.299
going to go and serve in the army.

cue0151243
01:32:11.299 --> 01:32:15.299
I mean, for me, at this point, with all due respect,

cue0151244
01:32:15.299 --> 01:32:18.700
I agree with the Mizrahi and the other things that they say,

cue0151245
01:32:18.700 --> 01:32:21.180
no, we've got to have yarmulkes and we'll go to the army.

cue0151246
01:32:21.180 --> 01:32:22.899
And I disagree with other people who say,

cue0151247
01:32:22.899 --> 01:32:24.500
no, it's haram to go to the army.

cue0151248
01:32:24.500 --> 01:32:25.580
Because that's one of the misrots.

cue0151249
01:32:25.580 --> 01:32:27.259
You cannot say, I'm going to choose

cue0151250
01:32:27.259 --> 01:32:28.660
which Mizrahi I want to follow.

cue0151251
01:32:28.660 --> 01:32:30.419
Then we are exactly like the Reform.

cue0151252
01:32:30.419 --> 01:32:32.819
The Reform also follows some misrots.

cue0151253
01:32:32.819 --> 01:32:34.660
So I believe that we have to become

cue0151254
01:32:34.660 --> 01:32:38.379
more conscious of our political and civic duties, which

cue0151255
01:32:38.379 --> 01:32:39.580
are part also of Judaism.
